{
    "title": "Spelling Quiz - Word Trivia",
    "description": "Millions of adults are unable to spell basic everyday words, a study suggests. Some words seem to be easy but people hesitate when spelling them. In response to this situation, we need to keep learning spelling to solve this problem.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s proven fact that learning new things in proper way helps you remember things quickly and for long-term! SpellingQuiz is a new educational English spelling game that will check and improve your spelling skills in an entertaining and challenging way!\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\nChoose the correct word from 4 similar spelling options before time runs out.\r\nTry a HINT to help you remove a wrong spelling option.\r\nUse +20s to add 20 seconds if you want more time.\r\nFind 3 correct words to pass a level.\r\nYou will get a gift every time you complete 4 levels.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nChallenging word game with thousands of questions!\r\nDaily bonus gems for free hints!\r\nMultiple question categories!\r\nPlay free spelling games OFFLINE or ONLINE - anytime, anywhere.\r\nExpand your knowledge by playing game!\r\nImprove your vocabulary and dictionary!\r\nA must game for all the spelling bee game fans!\r\n\r\nAre you good enough in spelling?\r\nJust download and start your quest now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Millions of adults are unable to spell basic everyday words, a study suggests. Some words seem to be easy but people hesitate when spelling them. In response to this situation, we need to keep learning spelling to solve this problem.<br><br>It\u2019s proven fact that learning new things in proper way helps you remember things quickly and for long-term! SpellingQuiz is a new educational English spelling game that will check and improve your spelling skills in an entertaining and challenging way!<br><br>HOW TO PLAY<br>Choose the correct word from 4 similar spelling options before time runs out.<br>Try a HINT to help you remove a wrong spelling option.<br>Use +20s to add 20 seconds if you want more time.<br>Find 3 correct words to pass a level.<br>You will get a gift every time you complete 4 levels.<br><br>Features:<br>Challenging word game with thousands of questions!<br>Daily bonus gems for free hints!<br>Multiple question categories!<br>Play free spelling games OFFLINE or ONLINE - anytime, anywhere.<br>Expand your knowledge by playing game!<br>Improve your vocabulary and dictionary!<br>A must game for all the spelling bee game fans!<br><br>Are you good enough in spelling?<br>Just download and start your quest now!",
